#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:5 ba102f6ef8ae4e049160f8231f6a3d0f
msgid "Tuning the Balance Bot"
msgstr "平衡机器人调参"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:8 a36f5bf9bb014c86935034722aa97caf
msgid "Tuning Pitch Control"
msgstr "俯仰控制调参"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:10
#: 8f18cdc406274903999394badda7b892
msgid ""
"The Pitch controller should be tuned in Manual mode. The parameters involved"
" in tuning this controller are:"
msgstr "俯仰控制器应在 Manual 模式下进行调参。涉及调参的参数如下："

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:12
#: 1482de39bb0c4da9ad1ce6cf5c2052b2
msgid ""
":ref:`BAL_PITCH_MAX<BAL_PITCH_MAX>`: Pitch angle limit.  If the user "
"provides full throttle the vehicle will attempt to lean at this angle"
msgstr ":ref:`BAL_PITCH_MAX<BAL_PITCH_MAX>`：俯仰角限制。用户提供满油门时，车辆将尝试以此角度倾斜"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:13
#: 654053663b974612a59d7f88caa3df90
msgid ""
":ref:`BAL_PITCH_TRIM <BAL_PITCH_TRIM>`: Pitch trim to offset tilt of center "
"of mass"
msgstr ":ref:`BAL_PITCH_TRIM <BAL_PITCH_TRIM>`：俯仰配平，用于补偿重心偏移"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:14
#: 81f4b53b36af41d7809972146ee73289
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_PIT_FF <ATC_BAL_PIT_FF>`: Feed forward gain using the current "
"pitch angle.  This should normally be set to 0.4"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_BAL_PIT_FF <ATC_BAL_PIT_FF>`：基于当前俯仰角的前馈增益。通常应设置为 0.4"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:15
#: 3316f0f97e6f47819eee55b2d48b99f4
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_FF <ATC_BAL_FF>`: Feed forward gain using desired pitch angle."
"  This should normally be set to 0"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_BAL_FF <ATC_BAL_FF>`：基于期望俯仰角的前馈增益。通常应设置为 0"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:16
#: 10322b8eea40400e9938f3c25a682542
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_P <ATC_BAL_P>`: P gain used to correct the current pitch angle"
" error.  Higher values will result in faster error correction but if too "
"high will lead to oscillation."
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_BAL_P <ATC_BAL_P>`：用于修正当前俯仰角误差的 P 增益。数值越大误差修正越快，但过大会导致震荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:17
#: 36320044cb26464a93d8bde88bf12f44
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_I <ATC_BAL_I>`: I gain used to correct long term pitch angle "
"errors.  Setting to the same value as P often works well.  If set too high "
"this could lead to slow oscillations."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_I <ATC_BAL_I>`：用于修正长期俯仰角误差的 I 增益。设置为与 P "
"相同的值通常效果良好。设置过高可能导致低频震荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:18
#: 99005060f06f4147b50440c785e57258
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_D <ATC_BAL_D>`: D gain used to correct changes in pitch angle "
"error.  Setting to higher values may result in a more stable pitch control "
"but if too high can lead to very fast oscillations."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_D <ATC_BAL_D>`：用于修正俯仰角误差变化率的 D 增益。设置较大值可能使俯仰控制更稳定，但过大会导致高频震荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:19
#: 436f63c644a94f1abd8a4228c1bd0904
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_IMAX <ATC_BAL_IMAX>`: I term maximum value.  This should "
"normally be set to 1"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_BAL_IMAX <ATC_BAL_IMAX>`：I 项最大值。通常应设置为 1"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:20
#: f31b4f0f5e2b4408a8c620e1a7fefc47
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_FLTT <ATC_BAL_FLTT>`: Filter applied to the desired pitch "
"angle.  Lower values lead to a slower moving desired pitch angle target.  "
"Higher values lead to a more responsive pitch target"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_FLTT "
"<ATC_BAL_FLTT>`：应用于期望俯仰角的滤波器。数值越小，期望俯仰角目标变化越慢；数值越大，俯仰目标响应越快"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:21
#: a86bb9fd5ee04c8cb4baef6f0441e1b2
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_FLTE <ATC_BAL_FLTE>`: Filter applied to the pitch error.  "
"Lower values lead to a slower response to pitch angle errors.  Higher values"
" lead to a faster response"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_FLTE <ATC_BAL_FLTE>`：应用于俯仰误差的滤波器。数值越小，对俯仰角误差的响应越慢；数值越大，响应越快"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:22
#: 96ed7740ee544137a0f4ddc87668e5ea
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_FLTD <ATC_BAL_FLTD>`: Filter applied to the pitch error "
"applied to the D term.  Lower values lead to a slower response to changes in"
" pitch angle errors.  Higher values lead to a faster response"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_FLTD <ATC_BAL_FLTD>`：应用于 D "
"项俯仰误差的滤波器。数值越小，对俯仰角误差变化的响应越慢；数值越大，响应越快"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:24
#: 0a52475b58cf4ad5ac5ee3653d28fcb0
msgid ""
"Good tuning of the pitch controller is crucial for tuning other Control "
"Modes."
msgstr "良好的俯仰控制器调参对于调整其他控制模式至关重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:27
#: f14d2ad3d825437bad293e2c29fd61ff
msgid "Real-time Tuning of Pitch Control"
msgstr "俯仰控制实时调参"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:29
#: 53c0f347a54443b6b42b508ef7b1ccb9
msgid ""
"It is best to connect the ground station (e.g. Mission Planner) to the "
"vehicle using a telemetry radio and then enable real-time display of the "
"Pitch PID controller's inputs and outputs by doing the following"
msgstr "最好通过遥测无线电将地面站（如 Mission Planner）连接到车辆，然后按照以下步骤启用俯仰 PID 控制器输入输出的实时显示"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:31
#: 346e3fdc538e45828e90bf11d2bfccee
msgid "Set :ref:`GCS_PID_MASK <GCS_PID_MASK>` = 4 (Pitch)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`GCS_PID_MASK <GCS_PID_MASK>` = 4（俯仰）"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:32
#: 80aa2091d7414a5894b919a9b66d67c0
msgid ""
"Connect with Mission Planner, go to the Data screen and check the \"Tuning\""
" checkbox in the bottom middle.  From the large \"Display This\" window "
"check \"piddesired\", \"pidachieved\" and optionally \"pidP\", \"pidI\" and "
"\"pidD\""
msgstr ""
"连接 Mission Planner，进入数据界面，勾选底部中央的「Tuning」复选框。在弹出的「Display "
"This」窗口中勾选「piddesired」、「pidachieved」，以及可选的「pidP」、「pidI」和「pidD」"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:33
#: 0a0d9c265b1245e8935a24da2c07830e
msgid ""
"Speed up the rate of the PID_TUNING messages using Mission Planner's Ctrl-F "
"Message Interval feature"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 的 Ctrl-F 消息间隔功能加快 PID_TUNING 消息的发送频率"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:38
#: db6e302ed99b4a8f8423e72079cfe4f9
msgid "Stand the vehicle upright and arm in Manual mode"
msgstr "将车辆竖立并在 Manual 模式下解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:39
#: 087b8728f709415ea3270407d77bcb06
msgid ""
"With the throttle stick in the middle the \"piddesired\" should always be "
"zero while the \"pidachieved\" will move as the vehicle pitches back and "
"forth"
msgstr "油门杆居中时，「piddesired」应始终为零，而「pidachieved」会随车辆前后俯仰而变化"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:40
#: dcb0074faa5249f6ad0e5d06d6b604b9
msgid ""
"Open Mission Planner's Config Full Parameter Tree and adjust :ref:`ATC_BAL_P"
" <ATC_BAL_P>`, :ref:`ATC_BAL_I <ATC_BAL_I>` and :ref:`ATC_BAL_D <ATC_BAL_D>`"
" gains so that \"pidachieved\" follows \"piddesired\" (e.g. stays near zero)"
msgstr ""
"打开 Mission Planner 的配置完整参数树，调整 :ref:`ATC_BAL_P <ATC_BAL_P>`、:ref:`ATC_BAL_I "
"<ATC_BAL_I>` 和 :ref:`ATC_BAL_D <ATC_BAL_D>` "
"增益，使「pidachieved」跟随「piddesired」（例如保持接近零）"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:41
#: 231d48af8cde4791966b7949652ef699
msgid ""
"The vehicle may drift off in either direction so be ready to catch it and "
"return it to its original position.  Drifting is not necessarily a problem "
"at this stage, the goal is for \"pidachieved\" to follow \"piddesired\" as "
"closely as possible"
msgstr ""
"车辆可能会向任一方向漂移，请做好准备随时抓住并归位。此阶段漂移不一定是问题，目标是让「pidachieved」尽可能紧密地跟随「piddesired」"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:42
#: 47860beaa2374d4aa40465514156730c
msgid ""
"Apply throttle stick inputs which should result in \"piddesired\" changing."
"  Continue to adjust the gains so \"pidachieved\" tracks well"
msgstr "推动油门杆，「piddesired」应随之变化。继续调整增益，使「pidachieved」能够良好跟踪"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:47
#: 75aa85421a834ebbaa99250463618330
msgid "Reducing Drift with Pitch Trim"
msgstr "使用俯仰配平减少漂移"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:49
#: 765028a3ddba449bbecaa1244b184d3c
msgid ""
"If the vehicle consistently drifts in one direction while upright in Manual "
"mode the center of mass may be slightly off of center.  :ref:`BAL_PITCH_TRIM"
" <BAL_PITCH_TRIM>` sets the default pitch angle at zero throttle."
msgstr ""
"如果车辆在 Manual 模式下直立时持续向一个方向漂移，重心可能略有偏移。:ref:`BAL_PITCH_TRIM <BAL_PITCH_TRIM>`"
" 设置零油门时的默认俯仰角。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:51
#: baf5f9066d2c48e0bbca9f089c7b8e78
msgid ""
"If the balance bot drifts forward, increase :ref:`BAL_PITCH_TRIM "
"<BAL_PITCH_TRIM>` in steps of 0.1 until the vehicle's drift is reduced.  If "
"the balance bot drifts backwards, decrease :ref:`BAL_PITCH_TRIM "
"<BAL_PITCH_TRIM>`."
msgstr ""
"如果平衡机器人向前漂移，以 0.1 为步长增大 :ref:`BAL_PITCH_TRIM <BAL_PITCH_TRIM>` "
"直至漂移减小。如果向后漂移，则减小 :ref:`BAL_PITCH_TRIM <BAL_PITCH_TRIM>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:54
#: 4251cc46417f4bc6986f609c7e451a88
msgid "Pitch Limiting"
msgstr "俯仰限制"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:56
#: b25b731ec68944aa9e008dba0b6d6ba9
msgid ""
"Rover-4.3 (and higher) includes automatic pitch limiting to reduce the "
"chance of the vehicle falling over due to throttle saturation.  The feature "
"works by monitoring the throttle output and if it crosses a given threshold "
"the maximum pitch angle is temporarily reduced."
msgstr ""
"Rover-4.3（及更高版本）包含自动俯仰限制功能，以减少因油门饱和导致车辆倾倒的概率。该功能通过监控油门输出实现，当油门超过给定阈值时，最大俯仰角会被临时降低。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:58
#: 7724cfb88e8d47c8b9223e3b4a996c4d
msgid ""
"The parameters below can be used to tune this features although normally "
"they can be left at their default values"
msgstr "以下参数可用于调整此功能，通常保持默认值即可"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:60
#: a2d6de75cfad4af8a3571ad57cbf9b03
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_LIM_THR<ATC_BAL_LIM_THR>`: pitch limit feature's throttle "
"threshold (expressed as a value betwee 0 and 1).  If the vehicle's throttle "
"climbs above this limit the vehicle's maximum pitch angle will be reduced."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_LIM_THR<ATC_BAL_LIM_THR>`：俯仰限制功能的油门阈值（取值在 0 到 1 "
"之间）。当车辆油门超过此限制时，车辆的最大俯仰角将被降低。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:61
#: 48143fb5ec994173956a17c7bd75490f
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_LIM_TC<ATC_BAL_LIM_TC>`: pitch limit feature's time constant."
"  Lower values will cause the pitch limit to be reduced quickly.  Higher "
"values will limit the pitch more slowly."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_BAL_LIM_TC<ATC_BAL_LIM_TC>`：俯仰限制功能的时间常数。数值越小，俯仰限制降低越快；数值越大，俯仰限制降低越慢。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:69
#: 77969bc921dd4de09c21c9c51e4d193e
msgid "Tuning Acro Mode"
msgstr "Acro 模式调参"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:71
#: 88ccb99d34784b5b8fcc50b4fa686b73
msgid "The following parameters should be set"
msgstr "应设置以下参数"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:73
#: 9037054e3ce444a1b9742948da9b932d
msgid ""
":ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE <CRUISE_THROTTLE>` = 0 (This parameter can cause "
"conflicts otherwise, in Balance Bots)"
msgstr ":ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE <CRUISE_THROTTLE>` = 0（否则此参数可能在平衡机器人上引发冲突）"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:74
#: f6495fb3d52a467d8197ec133d6e81ee
msgid ""
":ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>`: Maximum speed limit for Speed "
"Controller. To be set by trial and error"
msgstr ":ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>`：速度控制器的最大速度限制。需通过试验确定"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:76
#: 91b70ef3536b4f9aa71fcfb98453eb33
msgid ""
"With the above parameters set, follow the tuning guides for :ref:`Speed "
"<rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed>` and :ref:`Steering<rover-tuning-steering-"
"rate>`. Another important thing to note is that the feed-forward term "
"described in these pages does not make any positive contribution in a "
"balance bot and is best, set to zero."
msgstr ""
"设置上述参数后，请按照 :ref:`速度 <rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed>` 和 :ref:`转向<rover-"
"tuning-steering-rate>` "
"的调参指南操作。另一个重要注意事项是，这些页面中描述的前馈项在平衡机器人上不会产生正面贡献，最好将其设置为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:79
#: ebbcd8bbb19140b0bfc6e03642bdc3de
msgid "Guided, Auto, RTL"
msgstr "Guided、Auto、RTL"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:81
#: f7a2dd30e8c44f39b134666b7101b374
msgid ""
"Follow the :ref:`Navigation tuning instructions <rover-tuning-navigation>` "
"to tune the vehicle for autonomous modes including Guided, Auto and RTL."
msgstr ""
"请按照 :ref:`导航调参说明 <rover-tuning-navigation>` 为 Guided、Auto 和 RTL 等自主模式调整车辆。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:83
#: 97d6d098e80546d2bd2c04caa6ae34ee
msgid ""
"Optionally it may be convenient to automatically change the mode to Acro "
"after an Auto mission is completed by setting"
msgstr "可选地，通过设置以下参数，可在 Auto 任务完成后自动切换到 Acro 模式，这可能比较方便"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-tuning.rst:85
#: 484ca05ce5a74531b47ea0f0a46195ab
msgid ":ref:`MIS_DONE_BEHAVE <MIS_DONE_BEHAVE>` = 2 (Acro)"
msgstr ":ref:`MIS_DONE_BEHAVE <MIS_DONE_BEHAVE>` = 2（Acro）"
